<title>FRANCE: Moody's confirms Saint-Gobain rating.</title>
<headline>Moody's confirms Saint-Gobain rating.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said it confirmed the A1 senior long-term debt rating of Cie de Saint-Gobain following its announcement that it will acquire the Ball Corp's minority interest in Ball-Foster.</p>
<p>Ball-Foster will also acquire the assets and some liabilities of Anchor Glass Container Corp.</p>
<p>Moody's said the confirmation reflected the strategic value of these transactions.</p>
<p>The following ratings have been confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Compagnie de Saint-Gobain, Swiss bonds and global medium term note programme at A1.</p>
<p>-- Saint-Gobain Nederland BV, guaranteed Eurobonds at A1.</p>
<p>-- Compagnie de Saint-Gobain, Prime-1 rating for commercial paper.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
